WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.780
Centuries after the Buddha's death, new
Buddhist sutras began to appear in India.

2
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:10.130
Their followers called their
way the Great Vehicle: Mahayana.

3
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.550
Today Mahayana is the
largest Buddhist tradition,

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.980
from China and Korea to Japan and Tibet.

5
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.740
So why did so many Buddhists accept
these new sutras as scripture?

6
00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.450
In this mission, you'll meet the
key ideas of the Great Vehicle,

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.730
from compassion for all
beings to emptiness.

8
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:32.560
Then you'll set Theravada
and Mahayana side by side,

9
00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.070
row by row.

10
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:39.290
Your mission: find out why Buddhists
accepted sutras that appeared centuries after

11
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.050
the Buddha.
